  "RightShoulder",
  "Spine",
  "Spine01",
  "Spine02",
  "Hips"
 ],
 "baseRig": "goblin-grunt (Meshy 24-bone), rest pose in the GLB nodes",
 "packLegLength": 0.42603,
 "retarget": {
  "method": "align",
  "howto": "per bone b, parents first: D = Wpack_now(b) * inv(Wpack_rest(b)); C(b) = shortest rotation turning the unit rest direction (b -> child joint, world) onto the pack rest direction; bones without a child (hands, toes, head_end, headfront) use the parent C; Hips uses identity. Wunit_now(b) = D * C(b) * Wunit_rest(b); local = inv(Wunit_now(parent)) * Wunit_now(b). Hips position = unit rest + (pack hips world offset from rest) * legRatio, in the hips parent space. legRatio = unit leg / packLegLength (LeftUpLeg->LeftLeg->LeftFoot->LeftToeBase joint distances, world). Reference: ohrt-retarget-reference.py (numpy, glTF nodes).",
  "child": {
   "Hips": "Spine02",
   "Spine02": "Spine01",
   "Spine01": "Spine",
   "Spine": "neck",
   "neck": "Head",
   "Head": "head_end",
   "LeftShoulder": "LeftArm",
   "LeftArm": "LeftForeArm",
   "LeftForeArm": "LeftHand",
   "RightShoulder": "RightArm",
   "RightArm": "RightForeArm",
   "RightForeArm": "RightHand",
   "LeftUpLeg": "LeftLeg",
   "LeftLeg": "LeftFoot",
   "LeftFoot": "LeftToeBase",
   "RightUpLeg": "RightLeg",
   "RightLeg": "RightFoot",
   "RightFoot": "RightToeBase"
  }
 },
 "notes": [
  "Clips are in place; game moves the unit. walk/run: move at rootSpeed * legRatio (m/s).",
  "knockback/bowled: move the unit between events launch and land; they end back in base pose.",
  "defeat clips end lying (up to ~0.4 m off the tile on the pack rig). On the tall golem the lying body floats 4-11% of its height: optional per-unit ground snap for defeat.",
  "Some units have uneven leg lengths (golem left ankle sits higher in its own Meshy idle), so a foot can hover 2-8% of height during walk/run on those units; optional foot IK later.",
  "Right hand is the weapon hand; props ride the RightHand bone.",
  "v2 adds 25 Mixamo clips (source \"mixamo\"), retargeted with the same align method, wrists softened 50%, Hips lifted per frame so nothing sinks on goblin/gnome/dwarf/golem. Mixamo loops and get-ups start/end in their own stance, not the v1 base pose: cross-fade in and out.",
  "A per-unit ground snap at load (offset so the unit lowest point at frame 0 of biped-idle-01 matches its own Idle) removes the 2-5% hover some units get on Mixamo clips.",
  "v3 adds 2 seated rider clips for the Gnome Plow (kind ride / rideRam). Not in the random pools: pick them by slot. Seated pose on the pack rig: Hips joint 0.229 m above the floor (standing 0.391), toes 0.131 m up, hips 0.042 m back; scale by legRatio. Place the seat under the Hips; no ground offset for these kinds.",
  "v4 adds 11 per-card special moves (kind special / ability, field \"for\" = card). Not in random pools; pick them by slot. rocket-ride ends airborne in a riding pose (rocket prop under the hips); sewer-slide ends prone (on small units it floats 6-7% of height, golem 19%: snap to the floor like defeat). Events per clip; \"impact\" = first gameplay event time."
 ],
